INSERT INTO `playbook` VALUES (1,'2014-06-30-dragonfly-energetic-bear',1,'2014-06-30','dragonfly-energetic-bear','蜻蜓(Dragonfly,又名能量熊 Energetic Bear)是至少自 2011 年起活跃的网络间谍组织,主要针对欧美能源行业与工业控制系统。该组织利用鱼叉邮件、Lightsout/Hello 挖洞工具包实施水坑攻击,并通过植入木马的工控软件更新传播 Backdoor.Oldrea(Havex)与 Trojan.Karagany,还曾入侵三家工控软件供应商,将恶意程序与正规软件更新捆绑分发。','Dragonfly (aka Energetic Bear) is a cyberespionage group active since at least 2011, targeting primarily the energy sector and industrial control systems in the US and Europe. The group uses spear phishing emails, watering hole attacks via the Lightsout/Hello exploit kit, and trojanized ICS software updates to deliver Backdoor.Oldrea (Havex) and Trojan.Karagany. The group compromised three ICS software vendors to bundle malware with legitimate software updates.',NULL,6,13,0,5,5,8,0,48,239,'2014-06-30-dragonfly-energetic-bear.tar.gz',1,11,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2014-06-30-dragonfly-energetic-bear','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2014-06-30-dragonfly-energetic-bear','2014-06-30-dragonfly-energetic-bear.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1005,T1041,T1071.001,T1074.001,T1105,T1189,T1203,T1547.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,收集信息,数据泄露'),(2,'2023-04-07-muddywater',2,'2023-04-07','muddywater','MERCURY(污水/MuddyWater,芒果沙尘暴)利用 Log4j 漏洞获取初始访问,随后与 DEV-1084(Storm-1084/DarkBit)协同,对本地与 Azure 云环境实施破坏性作战,部署 DarkBit 勒索擦除器并大规模删除 Azure 资源。','MERCURY (MuddyWater/Mango Sandstorm) exploited Log4j vulnerabilities for initial access, then partnered with DEV-1084 (Storm-1084/DarkBit) to conduct destructive operations against on-premises and Azure cloud environments, deploying DarkBit ransomware wiper and mass-deleting Azure resources.','MERCURY and DEV-1084: Destructive Attack on Hybrid Environment',5,5,0,5,5,5,0,45,440,'2023-04-07-muddywater.tar.gz',1,40,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2023-04-07-muddywater','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2023-04-07-muddywater','2023-04-07-muddywater.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1003,T1021,T1059.001,T1486,T1572','侵害影响,凭据访问,命令控制,执行,横向移动'),(3,'2014-07-02-dragonfly-energetic-bear',3,'2014-07-02','dragonfly-energetic-bear','蜻蜓(Dragonfly,又名能量熊 Energetic Bear)是至少自 2011 年起活跃的网络间谍组织,主要针对欧美能源行业与工业控制系统。该组织利用鱼叉邮件、Lightsout/Hello 挖洞工具包实施水坑攻击,并通过植入木马的工控软件更新传播 Backdoor.Oldrea(Havex)与 Trojan.Karagany,还曾入侵三家工控软件供应商,将恶意程序与正规软件更新捆绑分发。','Dragonfly (aka Energetic Bear) is a cyberespionage group active since at least 2011, targeting primarily the energy sector and industrial control systems in the US and Europe. The group uses spear phishing emails, watering hole attacks via the Lightsout/Hello exploit kit, and trojanized ICS software updates to deliver Backdoor.Oldrea (Havex) and Trojan.Karagany. The group compromised three ICS software vendors to bundle malware with legitimate software updates.','Dragonfly: Cyberespionage Attacks Against Energy Suppliers',5,5,0,5,5,4,1,49,585,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2014-07-02-dragonfly-energetic-bear','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2014-07-02-dragonfly-energetic-bear','2014-07-02-dragonfly-energetic-bear.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1041,T1071,T1189,T1566','初始访问,命令控制,数据泄露'),(4,'2015-05-14-apt23-tropic-trooper',4,'2015-05-14','apt23-tropic-trooper','对 Tropic Trooper 报告提取数据中本地 TROJ_YAHAMAM 安装分支的刻意收窄重建。观测边界从报告所述 MSI 已投放之后开始,依次覆盖参数化的 Windows Installer 桥接、两个报告命名落地文件、精确的 INCS 服务创建命令及产生的服务审计记录。未绑定的钓鱼、漏洞利用、C2、外传与横向移动等备选分支均被排除,不拼接为合成事件。','A deliberately narrow reconstruction of the local TROJ_YAHAMAM installation branch in the existing Tropic Trooper report extraction. The observation boundary begins after the report-described MSI has already been staged. It follows a parameterized Windows Installer bridge, the two report-named drops, the exact INCS service-creation command, and the resulting service audit record. Unbound phishing, exploit, C2, exfiltration, and lateral-movement alternatives are excluded rather than joined into a synthetic incident.','2015.5.14.Operation Tropic Trooper：Relying On Tried-And-Tested Flaws To Infiltrate Secret Keepers.pdf',7,7,0,5,5,3,0,48,488,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2015-05-14-apt23-tropic-trooper','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2015-05-14-apt23-tropic-trooper','2015-05-14-apt23-tropic-trooper.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1014,T1218.007,T1543.003','持久化,防御规避'),(5,'2015-12-31-darkhotel',5,'2015-12-31','darkhotel','暗黑客栈（DarkHotel）APT组织利用Adobe Flash 0day漏洞（CVE-2015-8651）通过鱼叉式邮件向国内大型企业高管投递恶意SWF文档，漏洞利用后下载Trojan Downloader（update.exe），再通过mshta.exe拉取HTA文件落地并执行，最终窃取信息。','暗黑客栈（DarkHotel）APT组织利用Adobe Flash 0day漏洞（CVE-2015-8651）通过鱼叉式邮件向国内大型企业高管投递恶意SWF文档，漏洞利用后下载Trojan Downloader（update.exe），再通过mshta.exe拉取HTA文件落地并执行，最终窃取信息。',NULL,10,11,0,2,2,4,0,25,38,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2015-12-31-darkhotel','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2015-12-31-darkhotel','2015-12-31-darkhotel.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1036.005,T1105,T1204.002,T1218.005','命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(6,'2016-11-17-apt23',6,'2016-11-17','apt23','对报告提取所述 2016 年 10 月 KeyBoy 分支的单受害者重建。场景覆盖 Larung Gar RTF 诱饵投递、Word 漏洞利用、dw20.exe 释放器、wab32res.dll 安装与侧加载、Winlogon Shell 持久化、配置读取以及一个报告列出的 KeyBoy C2 端点。八月诱饵与备选 C2 地址被排除,不合并进同一事件。','A single-victim reconstruction of the October 2016 KeyBoy branch described by the existing report extraction. The scenario follows delivery of the Larung Gar RTF lure, Word exploitation, the dw20.exe dropper, installation and side-loading of wab32res.dll, Winlogon Shell persistence, configuration access, and one report-listed KeyBoy C2 endpoint. The August lure and the alternative C2 address are excluded rather than merged into one incident.','2016-11-17 - It’s Parliamentary - KeyBoy and the targeting of the Tibetan Community.pdf',11,20,0,5,5,7,1,49,997,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2016-11-17-apt23','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2016-11-17-apt23','2016-11-17-apt23.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1027,T1095,T1203,T1204.002,T1547.001,T1566.001,T1574.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(7,'2016-11-22-apt23',7,'2016-11-22','apt23','对 Tropic Trooper 毒藤(Poison Ivy)一个分支的受害者侧重建。所选片段覆盖恶意 XLSX 的投递与保存、Excel 漏洞利用、Identities.ocx 创建、Winlogon Shell 持久化、随后 rundll32 的 SSSS 导出启动,以及一个报告列出的裸 IP C2 连接。Yahoyah、PCShare 及未绑定的全局基础设施被排除。','A victim-side reconstruction of one Tropic Trooper Poison Ivy branch. The selected episode covers delivery and saving of the malicious XLSX, Excel exploitation, Identities.ocx creation, Winlogon Shell persistence, a later rundll32 SSSS-export launch, and one report-listed raw-IP C2 connection. Yahoyah, PCShare, and unbound campaign-wide infrastructure are excluded.','2016-11-22 - Tropic Trooper Targets Taiwanese Government and Fossil Fuel Provider With Poison Ivy.pdf',11,16,0,5,5,6,1,49,970,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2016-11-22-apt23','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2016-11-22-apt23','2016-11-22-apt23.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1095,T1140,T1203,T1218.011,T1547.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(8,'2018-03-13-muddywater',8,'2018-03-13','muddywater','基于 FireEye 2018 年 3 月披露的 TEMP.Zagros(污水/MuddyWater)第二种感染变体的有据重建。一份土耳其主题宏文档被投递、打开,用于落地 Defender.sct、DefenderService.inf 与 WindowsDefender.ini;Run 键在后续登录后启动 CMSTP,进而调用报告披露的 PowerShell 解码器与 POWERSTATS C2。更早的 VBS/MSHTA 变体因属于另一campaign阶段而非同一感染链,被刻意排除。','Source-backed reconstruction of the second TEMP.Zagros/MuddyWater infection variant described by FireEye in March 2018. One Turkish-themed macro document is delivered, opened, and used to drop Defender.sct, DefenderService.inf, and WindowsDefender.ini. The Run key launches CMSTP after a later logon, which invokes the report-disclosed PowerShell decoder and POWERSTATS C2. The earlier VBS/MSHTA variant is intentionally excluded because it was an alternative campaign phase, not another step in the same infection.',NULL,10,21,0,3,3,7,1,39,745,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2018-03-13-muddywater','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2018-03-13-muddywater','2018-03-13-muddywater.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1016.001,T1059.001,T1071.001,T1204.002,T1218.003,T1547.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,环境发现,防御规避'),(9,'2018-04-25-apt-c-01',9,'2018-04-25','apt-c-01','奇安信威胁情报中心2018年4月25日发布报告，披露APT-C-01组织利用CVE-2017-8759漏洞，通过鱼叉邮件投递PPT诱饵文档（“学习十九大新党章”），触发漏洞后通过mshta.exe下载HTA文件，再以PowerShell下载Loader（SCLoaderByWeb），Loader从C&C服务器下载.tmp格式XOR加密shellcode，解密后在新线程执行Poison Ivy远控模块，最终建立对Windows受害主机的C2回连通信。报告同时对C&C域名进行关联分析，揭示该团伙长期使用ChangeIP动态域名的基础设施特征，并关联出CVE-2017-0199漏洞文档和历史远控样本SENSODE、USEC1BACN。','奇安信威胁情报中心2018年4月25日发布报告，披露APT-C-01组织利用CVE-2017-8759漏洞，通过鱼叉邮件投递PPT诱饵文档（“学习十九大新党章”），触发漏洞后通过mshta.exe下载HTA文件，再以PowerShell下载Loader（SCLoaderByWeb），Loader从C&C服务器下载.tmp格式XOR加密shellcode，解密后在新线程执行Poison Ivy远控模块，最终建立对Windows受害主机的C2回连通信。报告同时对C&C域名进行关联分析，揭示该团伙长期使用ChangeIP动态域名的基础设施特征，并关联出CVE-2017-0199漏洞文档和历史远控样本SENSODE、USEC1BACN。','APT团伙（APT-C-01）新利用漏洞样本分析及关联挖掘',5,5,0,5,5,5,1,49,508,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2018-04-25-apt-c-01','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2018-04-25-apt-c-01','2018-04-25-apt-c-01.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1071,T1105,T1566.001,T1568.001,T1583.001','初始访问,命令控制,资源开发'),(10,'2018-09-19-greenspot',10,'2018-09-19','greenspot','绿斑报告中一条独立的2017年攻击分支：RTF利用CVE-2017-8759启动mshta，HTA调用PowerShell下载Poison Ivy载荷，载荷写入启动目录并回连。早期CVE-2012-0158、捆绑PE、Gh0st、ZXShell和其他诱饵分支被明确排除。','绿斑报告中一条独立的2017年攻击分支：RTF利用CVE-2017-8759启动mshta，HTA调用PowerShell下载Poison Ivy载荷，载荷写入启动目录并回连。早期CVE-2012-0158、捆绑PE、Gh0st、ZXShell和其他诱饵分支被明确排除。',NULL,6,17,0,5,5,7,1,49,590,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2018-09-19-greenspot','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2018-09-19-greenspot','2018-09-19-greenspot.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1059.001,T1071.001,T1105,T1203,T1204.002,T1547.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化'),(11,'2018-09-20-apt-c-01',11,'2018-09-20','apt-c-01','毒云藤（APT-C-01）鱼叉邮件攻击链训练场景。受害者打开利用 CVE-2017-8759 的恶意 RTF 后，SCLoader 加载 Poison Ivy 并维持周期 C2 心跳；攻击者随后执行侦察、创建计划任务并下发酷盘版二阶段木马，完成敏感文件搜索、归档和 HTTPS 外传。','毒云藤（APT-C-01）鱼叉邮件攻击链训练场景。受害者打开利用 CVE-2017-8759 的恶意 RTF 后，SCLoader 加载 Poison Ivy 并维持周期 C2 心跳；攻击者随后执行侦察、创建计划任务并下发酷盘版二阶段木马，完成敏感文件搜索、归档和 HTTPS 外传。',NULL,21,24,0,2,2,12,0,25,42,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2018-09-20-apt-c-01','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2018-09-20-apt-c-01','2018-09-20-apt-c-01.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1016,T1033,T1053.005,T1059.001,T1071.001,T1083,T1105,T1106,T1203,T1204.002,T1560.003,T1567.002','命令控制,执行,持久化,收集信息,数据泄露,环境发现'),(12,'2018-11-19-apt29-not-so-cozy',12,'2018-11-19','apt29-not-so-cozy','对 2018 年 11 月 Not So Cozy 钓鱼行动的受害者侧重建:报告观测到的唯一跟踪链接投递、ds7002.zip 下载解压、ds7002.lnk 启动、带动作的 PowerShell 解压命令、cyzfc.dat 与诱饵 PDF 的创建、rundll32 执行,以及报告公布的 Pandora 风格 Cobalt Strike 回连。攻陷第三方基础设施不在采集范围内。','A victim-side reconstruction of the November 2018 Not So Cozy phishing campaign: delivery of the report-observed unique tracking link, download and extraction of ds7002.zip, launch of ds7002.lnk, an action-bearing PowerShell extraction command, creation of cyzfc.dat and the decoy PDF, rundll32 execution, and the report-published Pandora-style Cobalt Strike callback. Compromising third-party infrastructure is outside the collected estate.','not-so-cozy-an-uncomfortable-examination-of-a-suspected-apt29-phishing-campaign.pdf',10,17,0,5,5,9,1,49,390,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2018-11-19-apt29-not-so-cozy','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2018-11-19-apt29-not-so-cozy','2018-11-19-apt29-not-so-cozy.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1027.009,T1059.001,T1071.001,T1105,T1140,T1204.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1566.002','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(13,'2019-03-05-transparenttribe',13,'2019-03-05','transparenttribe','TransparentTribe（又名ProjectM、C-Major）组织在2019年持续对印度政府部门、军事目标发起鱼叉邮件攻击，投递含VBA宏的xls/doc诱饵文档，宏执行后释放.NET RAT载荷（CrimsonRAT、PeppyRAT），实现持久化并回连C2窃取情报文件。','TransparentTribe（又名ProjectM、C-Major）组织在2019年持续对印度政府部门、军事目标发起鱼叉邮件攻击，投递含VBA宏的xls/doc诱饵文档，宏执行后释放.NET RAT载荷（CrimsonRAT、PeppyRAT），实现持久化并回连C2窃取情报文件。','TransparentTribe APT组织2019年针对印度政府、军事目标的攻击活动报告',19,24,0,5,5,9,5,53,416,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2019-03-05-transparenttribe','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2019-03-05-transparenttribe','2019-03-05-transparenttribe.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1041,T1059.005,T1071,T1071.001,T1105,T1113,T1547.001,T1547.009,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,收集信息,数据泄露'),(14,'2019-05-28-apt27',14,'2019-05-28','apt27','基于 Unit 42 报告对熊猫信使(Emissary Panda)SharePoint 入侵的有据重建。片段建模外部 CVE-2019-0604 请求、Antak Webshell 植入、若干后渗透上传、DLL 侧加载与 HyperBro C2 通信。报告在不同 Webshell/受害者上观测的 smb1.exe 活动被刻意排除,避免把多次入侵拼接为一条链。被涂黑的受害者取值仅以内部自洽的合成实验值替代。','Source-backed reconstruction of the Emissary Panda SharePoint intrusion reported by Unit 42. The episode models an external CVE-2019-0604 request, Antak webshell placement, selected post-exploitation uploads, DLL side-loading, and HyperBro command-and-control. The smb1.exe activity reported on a different webshell/victim is intentionally excluded so the chain does not splice separate intrusions together. Redacted victim values are replaced only with internally consistent synthetic lab values.',NULL,8,21,0,3,3,5,0,36,383,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2019-05-28-apt27','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2019-05-28-apt27','2019-05-28-apt27.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1071.001,T1140,T1190,T1505.003,T1574.001','初始访问,命令控制,持久化,防御规避'),(15,'2020-05-28-sidewinder',15,'2020-05-28','sidewinder','基于奇安信报告对响尾蛇(SideWinder)一条 LNK 感染链的有据重建。单一「政策指引」诱饵被投递执行:cmd.exe 启动 mshta.exe,首个 HTA 展示诱饵并获取第二阶段,StInstaller 写入报告观测的 font2Files 构件与 Run 键,rekeywiz.exe 侧加载 Duser.dll。其他诱饵样本与备选最终 C2 家族均不并入本片段。','Source-backed reconstruction of one SideWinder LNK infection chain from the Qianxin report. A single Policy Guidelines lure is delivered and executed; cmd.exe starts mshta.exe, the first HTA displays a decoy and obtains the second stage, StInstaller writes the report-observed font2Files artifacts and Run value, and rekeywiz.exe side-loads Duser.dll. Alternative lure samples and alternative final C2 families are deliberately not merged into this episode.',NULL,9,27,0,3,3,8,1,39,319,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2020-05-28-sidewinder','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2020-05-28-sidewinder','2020-05-28-sidewinder.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1071.001,T1105,T1140,T1218.005,T1518.001,T1547.001,T1566.001,T1574.001','初始访问,命令控制,持久化,环境发现,防御规避'),(16,'2021-01-30-lazarus',16,'2021-01-30','lazarus','Lazarus APT组织伪造安全研究人员身份，通过社交媒体（Twitter、LinkedIn、Telegram等）与目标建立联系，发送含恶意预生成事件的Visual Studio项目，诱导受害者编译触发恶意DLL执行，同时利用疑似Chrome浏览器0day漏洞通过博客投递加密payload，最终建立持久化并与C2服务器通信。','Lazarus APT组织伪造安全研究人员身份，通过社交媒体（Twitter、LinkedIn、Telegram等）与目标建立联系，发送含恶意预生成事件的Visual Studio项目，诱导受害者编译触发恶意DLL执行，同时利用疑似Chrome浏览器0day漏洞通过博客投递加密payload，最终建立持久化并与C2服务器通信。',NULL,13,13,0,2,2,6,0,24,37,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-01-30-lazarus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-01-30-lazarus','2021-01-30-lazarus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1027,T1059.001,T1071.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1547.001','命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(17,'2021-03-15-bitter',17,'2021-03-15','bitter','蔓灵花（BITTER）组织通过邮件投递含 CHM 文件的 RAR 压缩包，利用 CHM 内置脚本创建计划任务下载 ArtraDownloader，再逐步下发 MuuyDownLoader 和 .net 远控 msmpenq.exe，并分发文件收集、键盘记录、备份等插件模块，针对东亚、南亚政府、军工、电力、核能等单位。','蔓灵花（BITTER）组织通过邮件投递含 CHM 文件的 RAR 压缩包，利用 CHM 内置脚本创建计划任务下载 ArtraDownloader，再逐步下发 MuuyDownLoader 和 .net 远控 msmpenq.exe，并分发文件收集、键盘记录、备份等插件模块，针对东亚、南亚政府、军工、电力、核能等单位。','“Operation Magichm”浅谈蔓灵花组织的CHM文件投放与后续操作',13,19,0,5,5,7,1,49,807,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-03-15-bitter','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-03-15-bitter','2021-03-15-bitter.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1005,T1056.001,T1071,T1071.001,T1105,T1218.003,T1566.001','凭据访问,初始访问,命令控制,收集信息,防御规避'),(18,'2021-04-09-apt27',18,'2021-04-09','apt27','对铁虎(Iron Tiger)报告所述五文件 SysUpdate 感染例程的单分支重建。场景从报告所列文件已存在于 ProgramData 开始,依次建模签名加载器、DLL 侧加载、加密配置与载荷读取、注册表配置、配置删除、服务持久化,以及挂起的 svchost 载荷宿主。Pandora、Hidden、HyperBro、FRP 及不确定的初始访问备选均被排除。','A single-branch reconstruction of the five-file SysUpdate infection routine described in the Iron Tiger report. The scenario begins with the report-listed files already present under ProgramData, then models the signed loader, DLL side-load, encrypted configuration and payload reads, registry configuration, config deletion, service persistence, and the suspended svchost payload host. Pandora, Hidden, HyperBro, FRP, and uncertain initial-access alternatives are excluded.','2021-04-09 - Iron Tiger APT Updates Toolkit With Evolved SysUpdate Malware.pdf',11,13,0,5,5,6,0,46,956,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-04-09-apt27','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-04-09-apt27','2021-04-09-apt27.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1047,T1070.004,T1112,T1140,T1543.003,T1574.001','执行,持久化,防御规避'),(19,'2021-05-11-lazarus',19,'2021-05-11','lazarus','疑似Lazarus组织以大宇造船厂收购、居民登记表等韩语内容为诱饵，通过含VBA宏的doc文档投递，宏解密BMP图片中隐藏的HTA文件，经mshta执行JS代码释放Winvoke.exe加载器，加载器RC4解密内存中的RAT载荷，最终建立HTTP C2通信并通过启动文件夹LNK实现持久化。','疑似Lazarus组织以大宇造船厂收购、居民登记表等韩语内容为诱饵，通过含VBA宏的doc文档投递，宏解密BMP图片中隐藏的HTA文件，经mshta执行JS代码释放Winvoke.exe加载器，加载器RC4解密内存中的RAT载荷，最终建立HTTP C2通信并通过启动文件夹LNK实现持久化。','2021-05-11 - Analysis of a series of attacks by the suspected Lazarus organization using Daewoo Shipyard as relevant bait',7,7,0,5,5,6,1,49,757,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-05-11-lazarus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-05-11-lazarus','2021-05-11-lazarus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1027.003,T1071,T1105,T1140,T1204.002,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(20,'2021-06-08-sidewinder',20,'2021-06-08','sidewinder','响尾蛇（SideWinder）APT组织以大使馆向巴基斯坦委员会投资回信、建立港口防疫能力等外交政策信息为诱饵，投递仿冒PDF图标的LNK文件，经由mshta.exe加载远程HTA、内存加载多阶段.NET DLL、白加黑侧加载最终RAT，最终通过自定义C2协议窃取情报。2021年该组织在武器库方面的更新包括：二阶段载荷改为由服务器回传数据后续下载、API函数改用自定义封装混淆。','响尾蛇（SideWinder）APT组织以大使馆向巴基斯坦委员会投资回信、建立港口防疫能力等外交政策信息为诱饵，投递仿冒PDF图标的LNK文件，经由mshta.exe加载远程HTA、内存加载多阶段.NET DLL、白加黑侧加载最终RAT，最终通过自定义C2协议窃取情报。2021年该组织在武器库方面的更新包括：二阶段载荷改为由服务器回传数据后续下载、API函数改用自定义封装混淆。','SideWinder武器库更新：利用外交政策针对巴基斯坦的攻击活动分析',9,10,0,5,5,5,1,49,661,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-06-08-sidewinder','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-06-08-sidewinder','2021-06-08-sidewinder.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1041,T1071,T1105,T1547.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,持久化,数据泄露'),(21,'2021-06-10-apt15',21,'2021-06-10','apt15','从 BackdoorDiplomacy 报告收窄的 Windows Turian 重建。采集从 Webshell 已把 ScnCfg.exe 与 vsodscpl.dll 投放到一台面向互联网的 Windows 服务器后开始,随后覆盖有源支持的 DLL 加载、tmp.bat 持久化与清理。全局 C2 基础设施仅作为报告背景保留,因来源未将特定端点绑定到该加载器样本;F5/Linux、USB 与多受害者侦察等独立分支均被排除。','A narrowed Windows Turian reconstruction from the BackdoorDiplomacy report. Collection begins after a webshell has already staged ScnCfg.exe and vsodscpl.dll on an internet-facing Windows server, then follows the source-supported DLL load, tmp.bat persistence, and cleanup. Campaign-wide C2 infrastructure is retained only as report context because the source does not bind a specific endpoint to this loader sample. Separate F5/Linux, USB, and multi-victim reconnaissance branches are excluded.','2021-06-10 - BackdoorDiplomacy- Upgrading from Quarian to Turian.pdf',7,9,0,5,5,4,0,46,698,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-06-10-apt15','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-06-10-apt15','2021-06-10-apt15.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1059.003,T1070.004,T1547.001,T1574.001','执行,持久化,防御规避'),(22,'2021-11-23-donot-apt-q-38',22,'2021-11-23','donot-apt-q-38','Donot（肚脑虫，APT-Q-38）组织利用含CVE-2017-11882漏洞的RTF文档，释放下载器DLL，由下载器通过Google云盘获取C2地址并下载多个窃密插件，最终实现浏览器凭据、剪贴板、文档文件等信息的窃取与外传。','Donot（肚脑虫，APT-Q-38）组织利用含CVE-2017-11882漏洞的RTF文档，释放下载器DLL，由下载器通过Google云盘获取C2地址并下载多个窃密插件，最终实现浏览器凭据、剪贴板、文档文件等信息的窃取与外传。',NULL,29,29,0,8,8,11,0,42,297,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-11-23-donot-apt-q-38','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-11-23-donot-apt-q-38','2021-11-23-donot-apt-q-38.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1016,T1041,T1053.005,T1071.001,T1074.001,T1105,T1129,T1203,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1555.003','凭据访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,收集信息,数据泄露,环境发现,防御规避'),(23,'2021-12-23-apt-q-38-donot',23,'2021-12-23','apt-q-38-donot','对 Donot(APT-Q-38 肚脑虫)孟加拉教育诱饵的受害者侧重建。所选分支覆盖 PPT 投递、宏创建文件、计划任务持久化、delta.dll 执行及观测到的系统信息请求;未观测到的 acrobat.dll 响应分支被刻意排除。','A victim-side reconstruction of the Donot/APT-Q-38 Bangladesh education lure. The selected branch covers PPT delivery, macro-owned file creation, scheduled-task persistence, delta.dll execution, and the observed system-information request. The unobserved acrobat.dll response branch is deliberately excluded.','疑似“肚脑虫”APT组织近期针对孟加拉国的攻击活动分析 2021-12-23.pdf',12,22,0,5,5,7,1,48,470,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2021-12-23-apt-q-38-donot','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2021-12-23-apt-q-38-donot','2021-12-23-apt-q-38-donot.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1041,T1053.005,T1059.005,T1070.004,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1566.001','初始访问,执行,持久化,数据泄露,防御规避'),(24,'2022-02-24-muddywater',24,'2022-02-24','muddywater','FBI/CISA/CNMF/英国NCSC/NSA 联合对 23 个污水(MuddyWater)工具样本的恶意软件分析,包括 POWGOOP DLL 侧加载加载器、JavaScript PowerShell Beacon、Mori 后门,以及携带 WSF 载荷的 Canopy/Starwhale Excel 恶意软件,针对政府、电信、国防与油气行业。','Joint FBI/CISA/CNMF/NCSC-UK/NSA malware analysis of 23 MuddyWater tool samples including POWGOOP DLL sideloading loaders, JavaScript PowerShell beacons, Mori backdoor, and Canopy/Starwhale Excel-based malware with WSF payloads targeting government, telecom, defense, and oil/gas sectors.','Malware Analysis Report (AR22-055A) MuddyWater',7,8,0,5,5,5,0,46,714,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-02-24-muddywater','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-02-24-muddywater','2022-02-24-muddywater.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1071,T1071.001,T1082,T1204.002,T1574.001','命令控制,执行,环境发现,防御规避'),(25,'2022-07-14-crashoverride',25,'2022-07-14','crashoverride','对来源提取中一台工业工程工作站上 Windows 凭据转储分支的刻意收窄重建。建模报告列出的 comsvcs MiniDump 命令与三条 reg save 操作(SYSTEM、SECURITY、SAM),每个输出都归属其活动进程。初始访问、SSH/GPO 分发、Industroyer2 IEC-104 控制动作、INCONTROLLER 与破坏性影响,因属于独立分支或现有类型化事件面无法忠实表达而被排除。','A deliberately narrow reconstruction of the source-extracted Windows credential-dumping branch on one industrial engineering workstation. It models the report-listed comsvcs MiniDump command and the three report-listed reg save operations for SYSTEM, SECURITY, and SAM, with each output owned by its live process. Initial access, SSH/GPO distribution, Industroyer2 IEC-104 control actions, INCONTROLLER, and wiper impact are excluded because they are either separate branches or cannot be represented faithfully by the current typed event surface.','2022-07-14 - Industroyer2 and INCONTROLLER In-depth Technical Analysis of the Most Recent ICS-specific Malware .pdf',6,12,0,5,5,3,0,46,494,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-07-14-crashoverride','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-07-14-crashoverride','2022-07-14-crashoverride.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1003,T1003.001,T1003.002','凭据访问'),(26,'2022-07-22-apt-q-37-apt-q-41-apt-q-39',26,'2022-07-22','apt-q-37-apt-q-41-apt-q-39','Operation Tejas报告中一条独立的APT-Q-37蔓灵花DDE AUTO分支：2022年3月鱼叉邮件投递同哈希Word诱饵，DDE调用msiexec获取MSI，Scan.vbs创建两个计划任务，任务使用cmd与curl下载并启动Ngcctnr.exe。APT-Q-41、APT-Q-39、SFX、宏和其他互斥诱饵分支被明确排除。','Operation Tejas报告中一条独立的APT-Q-37蔓灵花DDE AUTO分支：2022年3月鱼叉邮件投递同哈希Word诱饵，DDE调用msiexec获取MSI，Scan.vbs创建两个计划任务，任务使用cmd与curl下载并启动Ngcctnr.exe。APT-Q-41、APT-Q-39、SFX、宏和其他互斥诱饵分支被明确排除。',NULL,6,20,0,5,5,7,1,49,742,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-07-22-apt-q-37-apt-q-41-apt-q-39','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-07-22-apt-q-37-apt-q-41-apt-q-39','2022-07-22-apt-q-37-apt-q-41-apt-q-39.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1053.005,T1059.005,T1105,T1204.002,T1218.007,T1559.002,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(27,'2022-09-08-lazarus',27,'2022-09-08','lazarus','基于 Cisco Talos《Lazarus and the tale of three RATs》报告对 VSingle 分支的有据重建。场景从针对公开 VMware Horizon 的外部 Log4Shell 攻击开始,沿报告披露的 node.exe 反弹 shell 分支推进:Defender 致损、基于 WinRAR 的 VSingle 部署、Active Directory 侦察,以及经 WMIC 向一台 Windows 服务器传播。MagicRAT、YamaBot 与全局 NTDS 变体因报告观测于不同受害者/入侵组而被刻意排除。','Source-backed reconstruction of the VSingle branch from Cisco Talos\' Lazarus and the tale of three RATs report. The scenario begins with an external Log4Shell attack against public VMware Horizon, follows the report-disclosed node.exe reverse-shell branch, Defender impairment, WinRAR-based VSingle deployment, Active Directory reconnaissance, and WMIC propagation to one Windows server. MagicRAT, YamaBot, and campaign-wide NTDS variants are intentionally excluded because the report observed them on different victims or intrusion sets.',NULL,15,35,0,3,3,12,0,39,1217,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-09-08-lazarus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-09-08-lazarus','2022-09-08-lazarus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1016,T1047,T1059.003,T1059.007,T1071.001,T1083,T1087.002,T1105,T1140,T1190,T1543.003,T1685','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,环境发现,防御规避'),(28,'2022-10-18-apt27',28,'2022-10-18','apt27','CERT Intrinsec 事件响应报告,详述 APT27 经 ProxyLogon 漏洞利用入侵 Microsoft Exchange,随后约一年内完成全域攻陷、凭据转储、横向移动与大规模数据外传。','CERT Intrinsec incident response report detailing APT27 intrusion via ProxyLogon exploitation of Microsoft Exchange, followed by domain-wide compromise, credential dumping, lateral movement, and large-scale data exfiltration over approximately one year.','APT27 – One Year To Exfiltrate Them All: Intrusion In-Depth Analysis',7,16,0,5,5,5,0,46,547,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-10-18-apt27','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-10-18-apt27','2022-10-18-apt27.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1003.001,T1003.003,T1090.001,T1482,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,环境发现,防御规避'),(29,'2022-12-27-bluenoroff-stardust-chollima',29,'2022-12-27','bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','蓝诺夫(BlueNoroff,Stardust Chollima)采用 ISO/VHD 磁盘镜像等新型恶意软件投递方式绕过 Mark-of-the-Web(MOTW)标记,引入 VBS/批处理/可执行下载器,并使用 70 余个仿冒日本风投与银行实体的假域名,针对加密货币与金融企业发起攻击。','BlueNoroff (Stardust Chollima) adopted new malware delivery methods including ISO/VHD disk images to bypass Mark-of-the-Web (MOTW), introduced VBS/batch/executable downloaders, and used 70+ fake domains impersonating Japanese venture capital and banking entities to target cryptocurrency and financial businesses.','BlueNoroff introduces new methods bypassing MoTW',6,6,0,5,5,5,2,50,741,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2022-12-27-bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2022-12-27-bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','2022-12-27-bluenoroff-stardust-chollima.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1071.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1553.005,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(30,'2023-05-22-bluenoroff',30,'2023-05-22','bluenoroff','Sekoia.io 关于蓝诺夫(Lazarus 子团)RustBucket 行动的报告,针对 macOS 与 Windows。感染链使用留有后门的假 PDF 阅读器,需一把特定「密钥 PDF」才触发恶意活动;目标为欧洲、亚洲、美国与阿联酋的加密货币交易所与风投机构。','Sekoia.io report on Bluenoroff (Lazarus subgroup) RustBucket campaign targeting macOS and Windows. Infection chain uses a backdoored fake PDF reader requiring a specific key PDF to trigger malicious activity. Targets cryptocurrency exchanges and venture capital entities in Europe, Asia, US and UAE.','Bluenoroff\'s RustBucket campaign',7,11,0,5,5,5,1,49,475,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2023-05-22-bluenoroff','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2023-05-22-bluenoroff','2023-05-22-bluenoroff.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1055,T1071,T1105,T1204.002,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(31,'2023-07-04-spyder',31,'2023-07-04','spyder','摩诃草（Patchwork/APT-Q-36）Spyder（WarHawk 变种）主链训练场景：伪装文件执行、HTTP C2 注册、计划任务持久化、指令获取、压缩载荷落地与执行。报告中的 Remcos 与 C# 轻量后门属于关联样本，未混入本次单一入侵链。','摩诃草（Patchwork/APT-Q-36）Spyder（WarHawk 变种）主链训练场景：伪装文件执行、HTTP C2 注册、计划任务持久化、指令获取、压缩载荷落地与执行。报告中的 Remcos 与 C# 轻量后门属于关联样本，未混入本次单一入侵链。',NULL,15,15,0,2,2,8,0,24,77,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2023-07-04-spyder','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2023-07-04-spyder','2023-07-04-spyder.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1053.005,T1070.004,T1071.001,T1105,T1140,T1204,T1204.002,T1547','命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(32,'2023-07-04-spyder-xxxxxxxxxxxx',32,'2023-07-04','spyder-xxxxxxxxxxxx','疑似摩诃草（APT-Q-36）组织使用WarHawk后门变种Spyder对中国、巴基斯坦、尼泊尔警察局、孟加拉国空军等多国目标发动攻击。Spyder样本以军政主题文件图标伪装，通过HTTP POST与C2通信，支持下载并执行后续载荷，并使用计划任务实现持久化。攻击者基础设施还关联了Remcos木马及C#编写的轻量级后门。','疑似摩诃草（APT-Q-36）组织使用WarHawk后门变种Spyder对中国、巴基斯坦、尼泊尔警察局、孟加拉国空军等多国目标发动攻击。Spyder样本以军政主题文件图标伪装，通过HTTP POST与C2通信，支持下载并执行后续载荷，并使用计划任务实现持久化。攻击者基础设施还关联了Remcos木马及C#编写的轻量级后门。','2023-07-04 疑似摩诃草组织利用WarHawk后门变种Spyder窥伺多国',10,10,0,5,5,4,1,49,260,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2023-07-04-spyder-xxxxxxxxxxxx','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2023-07-04-spyder-xxxxxxxxxxxx','2023-07-04-spyder-xxxxxxxxxxxx.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1055,T1071.001,T1105,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,防御规避'),(33,'2024-02-19-lazarus-defense-supply-chain',33,'2024-02-19','lazarus-defense-supply-chain','取自 BfV/NIS 联合通告的一个 Linux 研究中心分支。场景从凭据失窃的 SSH 访问开始,记录两次报告列出的 curl 下载,执行精确的 tcpdump 抓包命令,最终以易受攻击的 Web 应用写入报告命名的 _banner.jsp WebShell 收尾。被阻断的 PMS 补丁与独立的 Dream Job 行动被排除。','A single Linux research-center branch from the joint BfV/NIS advisory. The scenario begins with stolen-credential SSH access, records two report-listed curl downloads, runs the exact tcpdump capture command, and ends with the report-named _banner.jsp web shell written by the vulnerable web application. The blocked PMS patch and separate Dream Job campaign are excluded.','2024.02.19 - BfV and NIS warning of North Korean cyber threats targeting the Defense Sector.pdf',9,17,0,5,5,5,0,49,743,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2024-02-19-lazarus-defense-supply-chain','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2024-02-19-lazarus-defense-supply-chain','2024-02-19-lazarus-defense-supply-chain.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1040,T1059.004,T1105,T1133,T1505.003','命令控制,执行,持久化,环境发现'),(34,'2024-05-30-apt28',34,'2024-05-30','apt28','对报告提取中 Phase 3 BlueDelta 本地执行分支的刻意收窄重建。观测边界从 news_week_6.zip 已解压后开始,依次覆盖报告命名的良性计算器副本、同目录 WindowsCodecs.dll 侧加载、calc.cmd 执行、一个 VBScript 与一个 BAT 辅助脚本的创建,以及报告所述 300 秒 BAT 循环的启动。钓鱼、重定向、下载、C2、外传与凭据收割等变体均被排除,不合并为合成受害者时间线。','A deliberately narrow reconstruction of the Phase 3 BlueDelta local execution branch in the existing report extraction. The observation boundary begins after news_week_6.zip has already been extracted. It follows the report-named benign calculator copy, same-directory WindowsCodecs.dll side-load, calc.cmd execution, creation of one VBScript and one BAT helper, and startup of the report-described 300-second BAT loop. Phishing, redirection, download, C2, exfiltration, and credential-harvesting variants are excluded rather than merged into one synthetic victim timeline.','2024-05-30 GRU\'s BlueDelta Targets Key Networks in Europe with Multi-Phase Espionage Campaigns.pdf',10,10,0,5,5,3,0,48,461,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2024-05-30-apt28','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2024-05-30-apt28','2024-05-30-apt28.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1059.003,T1204.002,T1574.001','执行,防御规避'),(35,'2024-08-26-apt-q-12',35,'2024-08-26','apt-q-12','奇安信红雨滴团队披露 APT-Q-12（伪猎者）组织针对东北亚地区，利用 Win 平台邮件客户端 XSS 0day 漏洞（CEF 框架）以及 CVE-2017-5070 实施定向攻击，通过钓鱼探针邮件收集受害者邮件平台和 Office 软件信息后，投递 0day 触发邮件，实现木马落地、C2 回连和插件化后渗透（键盘记录、浏览器窃密、隧道工具、屏幕截图等）。另有针对 Android 平台邮件客户端的 0day 漏洞利用链。','奇安信红雨滴团队披露 APT-Q-12（伪猎者）组织针对东北亚地区，利用 Win 平台邮件客户端 XSS 0day 漏洞（CEF 框架）以及 CVE-2017-5070 实施定向攻击，通过钓鱼探针邮件收集受害者邮件平台和 Office 软件信息后，投递 0day 触发邮件，实现木马落地、C2 回连和插件化后渗透（键盘记录、浏览器窃密、隧道工具、屏幕截图等）。另有针对 Android 平台邮件客户端的 0day 漏洞利用链。','2024-08-26_Operation DevilTiger：APT-Q-12 使用 0day 漏洞技战术披露',7,8,0,5,5,5,1,49,702,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2024-08-26-apt-q-12','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2024-08-26-apt-q-12','2024-08-26-apt-q-12.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1056.001,T1071.001,T1105,T1190,T1221','凭据访问,初始访问,命令控制,防御规避'),(36,'2024-10-12-bitter-apt-q-37',36,'2024-10-12','bitter-apt-q-37','Bitter（APT-Q-37/蔓灵花）MiyaRat 1.1 主链训练场景：本地 MSI 执行、木马落地、计划任务持久化、TCP 长连接、远程命令与二级端口文件上传。报告中的历史 Havoc 活动未混入本次单一入侵链。','Bitter（APT-Q-37/蔓灵花）MiyaRat 1.1 主链训练场景：本地 MSI 执行、木马落地、计划任务持久化、TCP 长连接、远程命令与二级端口文件上传。报告中的历史 Havoc 活动未混入本次单一入侵链。',NULL,13,14,0,2,2,8,0,24,51,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2024-10-12-bitter-apt-q-37','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2024-10-12-bitter-apt-q-37','2024-10-12-bitter-apt-q-37.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1005,T1041,