bleFerret Python 木马以及具有命令执行和文件读写功能的后门 drvUpdate.exe。','Lazarus（APT-Q-1）将 ClickFix 社会工程手法融入虚假招聘钓鱼攻击，诱导受害者在面试网站上手动运行伪装成 Nvidia 驱动修复的恶意 bat 脚本，最终在 Windows 和 macOS 平台部署 BeaverTail 窃密软件、InvisibleFerret Python 木马以及具有命令执行和文件读写功能的后门 drvUpdate.exe。','故障修复之下的陷阱：Lazarus（APT-Q-1）近期利用 ClickFix 手法的攻击分析',8,8,0,5,5,7,0,46,963,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/2025-08-28-lazarus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/2025-08-28-lazarus','2025-08-28-lazarus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1059.003,T1059.007,T1071,T1071.001,T1105,T1204.002,T1566','初始访问,命令控制,执行'),(43,'aoqin-dragon',43,NULL,'aoqin-dragon','对所给傲钦龙(Aoqin Dragon)JSON 中假可移动设备 Evernote 侧加载分支的收窄受害者侧重建。一名用户打开可移动盘上参数化的 LNK,该 LNK 启动报告命名的 Evernote 应用 RemovableDisc.exe,进程加载 encrashrep.dll,将两个已知分支构件复制到报告命名的 EverNoteService 目录,并写入 EverNoteTrayUService Run 键。文档漏洞利用、Mongall、Heyoka、DNS 隧道、信息收集及进一步的可移动介质传播被视作独立或未绑定分支。','A narrow victim-side reconstruction of the fake removable-device Evernote side-loading branch in the supplied Aoqin Dragon JSON. One user opens a parameterized LNK on a removable drive, the LNK starts the report-named RemovableDisc.exe Evernote application, that process loads encrashrep.dll, copies the two known branch artifacts into the report-named EverNoteService directory, and writes the EverNoteTrayUService Run value. Document exploits, Mongall, Heyoka, DNS tunneling, collection, and further removable-media propagation are treated as separate or unbound branches.','Chen, Joey. (2022, June 9). Aoqin Dragon  Newly-Discovered Chinese-linked APT Has Been Quietly Spying On Organizations For 10 Years. Retrieved July 14, 2022..pdf',9,9,0,5,5,4,0,48,935,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/aoqin-dragon','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/aoqin-dragon','aoqin-dragon.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1091,T1204.002,T1547.001,T1574.001','执行,持久化,横向移动,防御规避'),(44,'apt-c-44-purplefox-2fe8',44,NULL,'apt-c-44-purplefox-2fe8','紫狐(Purple Fox)僵尸网络采用新型到达载体:伪装成正规应用(Telegram、360Doctor、PPHelper 等)的木马化软件安装器。感染链利用第一阶段 C&C HFS 服务器投递第二阶段载荷(svchost.txt),内含 FatalRAT 后门、rootkit 驱动与杀软灭杀组件。该行动与 Zegost 信息窃取器及早期紫狐活动存在强代码相似性。','Purple Fox botnet adopts a new arrival vector using trojanized software installers masquerading as legitimate applications (Telegram, 360Doctor, PPHelper, etc.). The infection chain uses a first-stage C&C HFS server to deliver a second-stage payload (svchost.txt) containing FatalRAT backdoor, rootkit drivers, and AV-killer components. The campaign shows strong code similarities with Zegost info stealer and earlier Purple Fox activities.','Technical Brief - A Look Into Purple Fox\'s New Arrival Vector',7,10,0,5,5,5,0,46,495,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt-c-44-purplefox-2fe8','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt-c-44-purplefox-2fe8','apt-c-44-purplefox-2fe8.json','2026-08-26 13:53:13','T1036,T1068,T1105,T1573,T1685','命令控制,权限提升,防御规避'),(45,'apt10',45,NULL,'apt10','取自 2019 年 Recorded Future APT10 报告的单一 Visma 入侵分支。建模边界从 2018 年 8 月 30 日 Citrix 会话重连开始:BITSAdmin 投放 Trochilus 链 1、CASTSP/version.dll 侧加载、unpack200/Mimikatz 凭据窃取、域控访问、NTDS 暂存与 Dropbox 外传。服装企业与律所的 UPPERCUT 分支被排除。','A single Visma intrusion branch from the 2019 Recorded Future APT10 report. The modeled boundary begins with an August 30, 2018 Citrix-session reconnection, BITSAdmin staging of Trochilus chain 1, CASTSP/version.dll sideloading, unpack200/Mimikatz credential theft, DC access, NTDS staging, and Dropbox exfiltration. The apparel-company and law-firm UPPERCUT branches are excluded.',NULL,8,25,0,5,5,9,0,46,1055,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt10','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt10','apt10.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003,T1003.003,T1055,T1078,T1105,T1560.001,T1567.002,T1573,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,收集信息,数据泄露,防御规避'),(46,'apt10-apt10',46,NULL,'apt10-apt10','APT10(石熊猫/menuPass)于 2017-2018 年针对 MSP Visma、一家美国律所与一家国际服装企业发动持续网络间谍行动(「云跳跃」Operation Cloud Hopper)。该组织利用失窃凭据访问 Citrix 系统,经 DLL 侧加载部署 Trochilus(RC4+Salsa20 变种)与 UPPERCUT 后门,用 Mimikatz 收割凭据,并以 cURL 将数据外传至 Dropbox。','APT10 (Stone Panda/menuPass) conducted a sustained cyberespionage campaign (Operation Cloud Hopper) targeting MSP Visma, a U.S. law firm, and an international apparel company between 2017-2018. The group used stolen credentials to access Citrix systems, deployed Trochilus (RC4+Salsa20 variant) and UPPERCUT backdoors via DLL sideloading, harvested credentials with Mimikatz, and exfiltrated data to Dropbox using cURL.','APT10 Targeted Norwegian MSP and US Companies in Sustained Campaign',8,17,0,5,5,5,0,46,731,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt10-apt10','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt10-apt10','apt10-apt10.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003.003,T1105,T1567.002,T1573,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,数据泄露,防御规避'),(47,'apt27',47,NULL,'apt27','APT27(熊猫信使)利用 CVE-2019-0604 在两个中东政府组织的 SharePoint 服务器上植入 WebShell,随后上传后渗透工具转储凭据、开展网络侦察,并利用永恒蓝(MS17-010)与失窃凭据横向移动。','APT27 (Emissary Panda) exploited CVE-2019-0604 to install webshells on SharePoint servers at two Middle East government organizations, then uploaded post-exploitation tools to dump credentials, perform network reconnaissance, and pivot laterally using EternalBlue (MS17-010) and stolen credentials.','Emissary Panda Attacks Middle East Government SharePoint Servers',6,14,0,5,5,4,0,45,434,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt27','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt27','apt27.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003,T1046,T1071,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,环境发现,防御规避'),(48,'apt27-7306',48,NULL,'apt27-7306','CERT Intrinsec 事件响应报告,详述 APT27 经 ProxyLogon 漏洞利用入侵 Microsoft Exchange,随后约一年内完成全域攻陷、凭据转储、横向移动与大规模数据外传。','CERT Intrinsec incident response report detailing APT27 intrusion via ProxyLogon exploitation of Microsoft Exchange, followed by domain-wide compromise, credential dumping, lateral movement, and large-scale data exfiltration over approximately one year.','APT27 – One Year To Exfiltrate Them All: Intrusion In-Depth Analysis',7,16,0,5,5,5,0,45,683,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt27-7306','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt27-7306','apt27-7306.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003.001,T1003.003,T1090.001,T1482,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,环境发现,防御规避'),(49,'apt27-bf71',49,NULL,'apt27-bf71','APT27(熊猫信使)利用 CVE-2019-0604 在两个中东政府组织的 SharePoint 服务器上植入 WebShell,随后上传后渗透工具转储凭据、开展网络侦察,并利用永恒蓝(MS17-010)与失窃凭据横向移动。','APT27 (Emissary Panda) exploited CVE-2019-0604 to install webshells on SharePoint servers at two Middle East government organizations, then uploaded post-exploitation tools to dump credentials, perform network reconnaissance, and pivot laterally using EternalBlue (MS17-010) and stolen credentials.','Emissary Panda Attacks Middle East Government SharePoint Servers',6,14,0,5,5,4,0,46,644,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt27-bf71','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt27-bf71','apt27-bf71.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003,T1046,T1071,T1574.001','凭据访问,命令控制,环境发现,防御规避'),(50,'apt27-e617',50,NULL,'apt27-e617','DRBControl(关联 APT27/铁虎/幸运鼠)行动针对东南亚博彩公司,利用鱼叉邮件、以 Dropbox 为 C2 的定制后门、PlugX、HyperBro 与 Trochilus RAT 实施网络间谍与竞争情报窃取。','DRBControl (linked to APT27/Iron Tiger/LuckyMouse) campaign targeting gambling and betting companies in Southeast Asia, using spear phishing, custom backdoors with Dropbox C2, PlugX, HyperBro, and Trochilus RAT for cyberespionage and competitive intelligence gathering.','Uncovering DRBControl: Inside the Cyberespionage Campaign Targeting Gambling Operations',7,17,0,5,5,4,1,49,979,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt27-e617','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt27-e617','apt27-e617.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003,T1102.001,T1566.001,T1574.001','凭据访问,初始访问,命令控制,防御规避'),(51,'apt29-72e3',51,NULL,'apt29-72e3','对 Constant Contact 行动 NativeZone 分支的单受害者重建。场景覆盖 USAID 主题链接投递、报告所述重定向与 HTML 指纹采集、HTML 走私方式生成 ISO、经 rundll32 执行 Documents.dll,以及一个选定 NativeZone C2 域名。BoomBox 等其他行动变体被排除。','A single-victim reconstruction of the Constant Contact campaign\'s NativeZone branch. The scenario follows delivery of the USAID-themed link, the report-described redirect and HTML fingerprinting, HTML-smuggled ISO creation, execution of Documents.dll through rundll32, and one selected NativeZone C2 domain. BoomBox and other campaign variants are excluded.','Microsoft Threat Intelligence Center (MSTIC). (2021, May 27). New sophisticated email-based attack from NOBELIUM. Retrieved May 28, 2021..pdf',11,17,0,5,5,8,1,49,696,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-72e3','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-72e3','apt29-72e3.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1027.006,T1071.001,T1105,T1204.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1566.002,T1592','侦察目标,初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(52,'apt29-9568',52,NULL,'apt29-9568','对 EnvyScout 注册表分支的单受害者重建。场景覆盖 HTML 诱饵的投递与保存、浏览器侧 ISO 走私、挂载后 HTA 的执行、两个来源所述 Javasoft 注册表值、读取注册表的 PowerShell 启动器的具体训练实现,以及一个针对伊朗目标的 Cobalt Strike 域名。土耳其样本与备选注册表分支被排除。','A single-victim reconstruction of the EnvyScout registry branch. The scenario follows delivery and saving of an HTML lure, browser-based ISO smuggling, execution of the mounted HTA, two source-described Javasoft registry values, a concrete training implementation of the registry-reading PowerShell launcher, and one Iranian-targeting Cobalt Strike domain. The Turkish sample and alternative registry branch are excluded.','2022-01-06 - NOBELIUM’s EnvyScout infection chain goes in the registry, targeting embassies.pdf',11,18,0,5,5,7,1,49,1024,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-9568','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-9568','apt29-9568.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1027.006,T1059.001,T1071.001,T1112,T1204.002,T1218.005,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(53,'apt29-adfs',53,NULL,'apt29-adfs','对从所给 JSON 提取的 FoggyWeb 安装与 DLL 搜索顺序劫持分支的收窄受害者侧重建。所选观测从一台 AD FS 服务器上两个来源所述文件落地开始,经 mscoreei.dll 与恶意 version.dll 完成参数化的服务重启,止于服务进程读取加密的 FoggyWeb PRI 文件。未指明的凭据窃取、横向移动、被动内存 HTTP 钩子、密钥材料、C2 客户端及附加载荷不予呈现。','A narrow victim-side reconstruction of the FoggyWeb installation and DLL search-order hijacking branch extracted from the supplied JSON. The selected observation begins with two source-described file drops on one AD FS server, follows a parameterized service restart through mscoreei.dll and the malicious version.dll, and ends after the service process reads the encrypted FoggyWeb PRI file. Unspecified credential theft, lateral movement, passive in-memory HTTP hooks, secret material, command-and-control clients, and added payloads are not rendered.','2021-09-27 - FoggyWeb- Targeted NOBELIUM malware leads to persistent backdoor.pdf',7,11,0,5,5,3,0,46,687,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-adfs','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-adfs','apt29-adfs.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1027,T1140,T1574.001','防御规避'),(54,'apt29-b113',54,NULL,'apt29-b113','基于 Mandiant《Eye Spy on Your Email》报告对 UNC3524/QUIETEXIT 的有据重建。因报告明确初始攻陷方式未知,不透明设备的初始攻陷被刻意置于观测边界之外。建模片段从 QUIETEXIT 在受害设备上执行开始,展示其角色反转的 SSH 传输、隧道内 WMI 活动、reg save 凭据收集与 Exchange Web Services 邮箱枚举。','Source-backed UNC3524/QUIETEXIT reconstruction based on Mandiant\'s Eye Spy on Your Email report. Initial compromise of the opaque appliance is intentionally left outside the observed boundary because the report says it was unknown. The modeled episode begins with QUIETEXIT executing on the victim appliance, then shows its reversed-role SSH transport, tunneled WMI activity, reg save credential collection, and Exchange Web Services mailbox enumeration.',NULL,9,22,0,3,3,4,0,40,787,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-b113','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-b113','apt29-b113.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003.002,T1047,T1114.002,T1572','凭据访问,命令控制,执行,收集信息'),(55,'apt29-dfdd',55,NULL,'apt29-dfdd','仅基于现有结构化提取,对一台 AD FS 服务器上 MagicWeb 安装分支的刻意收窄重建。观测边界从带后门的 Microsoft.IdentityServer.Diagnostics.dll 已暂存于 Windows Temp 开始,依次覆盖参数化的本地复制到独立 GAC 身份目录、报告所述 AD FS 配置改写,以及服务宿主重启后加载未签名 DLL。凭据获取、横向移动、令牌伪造与依赖方利用因具体实例未披露而被排除。','A deliberately narrow reconstruction of the MagicWeb installation branch on one AD FS server, based only on the existing structured extraction. The observation boundary begins with the backdoored Microsoft.IdentityServer.Diagnostics.dll already staged in Windows Temp. It follows a parameterized local copy into a distinct GAC identity directory, the report-described AD FS configuration rewrite, and the service host loading the unsigned DLL after restart. Credential acquisition, lateral movement, token forgery, and relying-party use are excluded because their concrete instances are not disclosed.','2022-08-24 - MagicWeb- NOBELIUM’s post-compromise trick to authenticate as anyone.pdf',9,9,0,5,5,1,0,47,684,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-dfdd','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-dfdd','apt29-dfdd.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1556','凭据访问'),(56,'apt29-e900',56,NULL,'apt29-e900','对从 Trello 行动 JSON 提取的 BOOMMIC DLL 侧加载分支的收窄受害者侧重建。观测边界从 jucheck.exe、version.dll 与 javafx_font.dll 被一同放置后开始,建模 Java Update Run 键、来源列出的 WMIC 启动、WMI 提供程序执行边界,以及 jucheck.exe -> version.dll -> javafx_font.dll 加载链。ROOTSAW、BEATDROP 与 Cobalt Strike 被排除。','A narrow victim-side reconstruction of the BOOMMIC DLL side-loading branch extracted from the Trello campaign JSON. The observation boundary begins after jucheck.exe, version.dll, and javafx_font.dll were placed together. It models the Java Update Run value, the source-listed WMIC launch, the WMI provider execution boundary, and the jucheck.exe -> version.dll -> javafx_font.dll load chain. ROOTSAW, BEATDROP, and Cobalt Strike are excluded.','2022-04-28 - Trello From the Other Side- Tracking APT29 Phishing Campaigns.pdf',7,12,0,5,5,3,0,48,936,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt29-e900','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt29-e900','apt29-e900.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1047,T1547.001,T1574.001','执行,持久化,防御规避'),(57,'apt36',57,NULL,'apt36','疑似 APT36（透明部落）使用 Golang 开发的双平台（Windows/Linux）后门 StealthServer，通过 .desktop 文件和含恶意宏的 PPT 文档投递，实现文件窃取和远程命令执行，C2 通信支持 TCP Socket、HTTP 和 WebSocket 协议。','疑似 APT36（透明部落）使用 Golang 开发的双平台（Windows/Linux）后门 StealthServer，通过 .desktop 文件和含恶意宏的 PPT 文档投递，实现文件窃取和远程命令执行，C2 通信支持 TCP Socket、HTTP 和 WebSocket 协议。','南亚某组织的双平台后门：StealthServer',15,15,0,5,5,10,1,46,1030,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt36','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt36','apt36.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1036,T1037.004,T1041,T1071,T1071.001,T1095,T1497,T1566.001,T1566.002,T1573.001','初始访问,命令控制,持久化,数据泄露,防御规避'),(58,'apt36-83d4',58,NULL,'apt36-83d4','对 JSON 提取的 Windows-V1 StealthServer 分支的收窄受害者侧重建。覆盖报告命名 PPAM 的投递与打开、来自 filestore.space 的两次宏下载、nodejs.exe 执行、自复制与 Run 键持久化,以及 Windows-V1 到 modindia.serveminecraft.net 的 TCP 连接。Windows V2/V3 与全部 Linux 分支被排除。','A narrow victim-side reconstruction of the JSON-extracted Windows-V1 StealthServer branch. It covers delivery and opening of the report-named PPAM, the two macro downloads from filestore.space, execution of nodejs.exe, self-copy and Run-key persistence, and the Windows-V1 TCP connection to modindia.serveminecraft.net. Windows V2/V3 and every Linux branch are excluded.','透明部落-apt-report.pdf',11,21,0,5,5,7,1,49,752,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/apt36-83d4','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/apt36-83d4','apt36-83d4.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1036,T1071,T1105,T1204.002,T1547.001,T1564.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(59,'bluenoroff-lazarus',59,NULL,'bluenoroff-lazarus','蓝诺夫(Bluenoroff)利用 RustBucket 恶意软件,经假 PDF 阅读器针对 macOS 与 Windows。感染链包括 ZIP+LNK 钓鱼、MSI/OneNote 文件,以及一个留有后门的 PDF 查看器——它会联系 C2 下载下一阶段载荷。','Bluenoroff leverages RustBucket malware targeting macOS and Windows via fake PDF readers. Infection chains include ZIP+LNK phishing, MSI/OneNote files, and a backdoored PDF viewer that contacts C2 to download next-stage payloads.','Bluenoroff\'s RustBucket campaign',8,9,0,5,5,6,1,49,765,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/bluenoroff-lazarus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/bluenoroff-lazarus','bluenoroff-lazarus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1055,T1071,T1071.001,T1105,T1218.011,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,防御规避'),(60,'bluenoroff-stardust-chollima',60,NULL,'bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','蓝诺夫(BlueNoroff,Stardust Chollima)采用 ISO/VHD 磁盘镜像等新型恶意软件投递方式绕过 Mark-of-the-Web(MOTW)标记,引入 VBS/批处理/可执行下载器,并使用 70 余个仿冒日本风投与银行实体的假域名,针对加密货币与金融企业发起攻击。','BlueNoroff (Stardust Chollima) adopted new malware delivery methods including ISO/VHD disk images to bypass Mark-of-the-Web (MOTW), introduced VBS/batch/executable downloaders, and used 70+ fake domains impersonating Japanese venture capital and banking entities to target cryptocurrency and financial businesses.','BlueNoroff introduces new methods bypassing MoTW',6,6,0,5,5,5,2,50,569,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/bluenoroff-stardust-chollima','bluenoroff-stardust-chollima.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1071.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1553.005,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(61,'chimera',61,NULL,'chimera','对报告提取中 WolfsBane Linux「释放器-启动器-后门」分支的受害者侧重建。所选片段从明确的攻陷后边界开始,沿 cron 投放 kde 与 udevd 推进,仅选取 systemd 持久化备选项,记录用户态 rootkit 与释放器自删除,止于 udevd 经 TLS 联系 dsdsei.com。','A victim-side reconstruction of the report extraction\'s WolfsBane Linux dropper-launcher-backdoor branch. The selected episode begins at an explicit post-compromise boundary, follows cron dropping kde and udevd, selects only the systemd persistence alternative, records the userland rootkit and dropper self-deletion, and ends after udevd contacts dsdsei.com over TLS.','2024.11.21 - Unveiling WolfsBane - Gelsemiums Linux counterpart to Gelsevirine.pdf',11,14,0,5,5,5,0,47,290,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/chimera','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/chimera','chimera.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1014,T1036,T1070.004,T1543.002,T1573.001','命令控制,持久化,防御规避'),(62,'chinese-state-sponsored',62,NULL,'chinese-state-sponsored','荷兰情报机构 MIVD 与 AIVD 发现 COATHANGER——一种针对 FortiGate 设备的隐蔽 RAT,由中国国家级行为体在利用 CVE-2022-42475 后部署。COATHANGER 提供持久后门访问,可在重启与固件升级后存活,并通过挂钩系统调用实现自我隐藏。','Dutch intelligence services MIVD & AIVD discovered COATHANGER, a stealthy RAT targeting FortiGate devices, deployed by Chinese state-sponsored actors after exploiting CVE-2022-42475. COATHANGER provides persistent backdoor access, survives reboots and firmware upgrades, and hides itself by hooking system calls.','Ministry of Defence of the Netherlands uncovers COATHANGER, a stealthy Chinese FortiGate RAT',6,6,0,5,5,5,0,43,498,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/chinese-state-sponsored','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/chinese-state-sponsored','chinese-state-sponsored.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1071,T1105,T1129,T1547,T1574.006','命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(63,'desert-falcons',63,NULL,'desert-falcons','沙漠之隼(Desert Falcons,AridViper)是一个来自中东、讲阿拉伯语的网络间谍组织。其利用鱼叉邮件、Facebook 社工、假网站与自研后门(Falcons 木马、DHS 间谍软件、iRAT),针对埃及、巴勒斯坦、以色列与约旦的政府、军事、媒体和金融机构。','Desert Falcons (AridViper) is an Arabic-speaking cyber espionage group operating from the Middle East. They used spear phishing emails, social engineering via Facebook, fake websites, and homemade backdoors (Falcons Trojan, DHS spyware, iRAT) to target government, military, media, and financial organizations across Egypt, Palestine, Israel, and Jordan.','The Desert Falcons Targeted Attacks',7,8,0,5,5,5,1,49,398,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/desert-falcons','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/desert-falcons','desert-falcons.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1071.001,T1113,T1204.002,T1566.001,T1566.003','初始访问,命令控制,执行,收集信息'),(64,'dragonfly-energetic-bear',64,NULL,'dragonfly-energetic-bear','蜻蜓(Dragonfly,又名能量熊 Energetic Bear)是至少自 2011 年起活跃的网络间谍组织,主要针对欧美能源行业与工业控制系统。该组织利用鱼叉邮件、Lightsout/Hello 挖洞工具包实施水坑攻击,并通过植入木马的工控软件更新传播 Backdoor.Oldrea(Havex)与 Trojan.Karagany,还曾入侵三家工控软件供应商,将恶意程序与正规软件更新捆绑分发。','Dragonfly (aka Energetic Bear) is a cyberespionage group active since at least 2011, targeting primarily the energy sector and industrial control systems in the US and Europe. The group uses spear phishing emails, watering hole attacks via the Lightsout/Hello exploit kit, and trojanized ICS software updates to deliver Backdoor.Oldrea (Havex) and Trojan.Karagany. The group compromised three ICS software vendors to bundle malware with legitimate software updates.','Dragonfly: Cyberespionage Attacks Against Energy Suppliers',5,5,0,5,5,4,1,49,741,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/dragonfly-energetic-bear','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/dragonfly-energetic-bear','dragonfly-energetic-bear.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1041,T1071,T1189,T1566','初始访问,命令控制,数据泄露'),(65,'earth-yako',65,NULL,'earth-yako','Earth Yako 是一个被归因于 RestyLink/EneLink 行动的 APT 组织,自 2021 年起针对日本学术机构与智库研究人员,亦有部分攻击台湾。该组织以钓鱼链接投递含恶意 .lnk 的 .zip/.iso 文件,部署滥用 Dropbox API 作为 C2 的新兴恶意软件家族(MirrorKey、TransBox、PlugBox、ShellBox、PULink、Dulload),并频繁根据地缘政治事件更换工具与目标。','Earth Yako is an APT group attributed to Operation RestyLink/EneLink, targeting researchers at academic organizations and think tanks in Japan since 2021, with some attacks on Taiwan. The group uses spearphishing links delivering .zip/.iso files with malicious .lnk files, deploying novel malware families (MirrorKey, TransBox, PlugBox, ShellBox, PULink, Dulload) that abuse the Dropbox API for C2. The group frequently changes tools and targets based on current geopolitical events.','Invitation to a Secret Event: Uncovering Earth Yako\'s Campaigns',8,9,0,5,5,6,1,49,821,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/earth-yako','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/earth-yako','earth-yako.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1071,T1102,T1129,T1547,T1566,T1567','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,数据泄露'),(66,'earth-yako-yako',66,NULL,'earth-yako-yako','Earth Yako 是一个被归因于 RestyLink/EneLink 行动的 APT 组织,自 2021 年起针对日本学术机构与智库研究人员,亦有部分攻击台湾。该组织以钓鱼链接投递含恶意 .lnk 的 .zip/.iso 文件,部署滥用 Dropbox API 作为 C2 的新兴恶意软件家族(MirrorKey、TransBox、PlugBox、ShellBox、PULink、Dulload),并频繁根据地缘政治事件更换工具与目标。','Earth Yako is an APT group attributed to Operation RestyLink/EneLink, targeting researchers at academic organizations and think tanks in Japan since 2021, with some attacks on Taiwan. The group uses spearphishing links delivering .zip/.iso files with malicious .lnk files, deploying novel malware families (MirrorKey, TransBox, PlugBox, ShellBox, PULink, Dulload) that abuse the Dropbox API for C2. The group frequently changes tools and targets based on current geopolitical events.','Invitation to a Secret Event: Uncovering Earth Yako\'s Campaigns',8,9,0,5,5,6,1,49,697,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/earth-yako-yako','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/earth-yako-yako','earth-yako-yako.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1071,T1102,T1129,T1547,T1566,T1567','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,数据泄露'),(67,'lazarus-de46',67,NULL,'lazarus-de46','2019 年「拦截行动」(Operation In(ter)ception)的一个连贯分支:假猎头邮件链至带密码的 OneDrive RAR,其 LNK 启动 cmd,把 WMIC 复制为 nvc.exe,创建计划 XSL 任务,解码并运行第一阶段 DLL,连接报告列出的 HTTPS C2,将场景参数化的工程文件归档,并用 dbxcli 上传。LinkedIn 直接投递与独立的 BEC 分支被排除。','One coherent 2019 Operation In(ter)ception branch: a fake recruiter email links to a password-protected OneDrive RAR, its LNK starts cmd, copies WMIC as nvc.exe, creates a scheduled XSL task, decodes and runs the stage-1 DLL, reaches the report-listed HTTPS C2, archives a scenario-parameter engineering file, and uploads it with dbxcli. Direct LinkedIn delivery and the separate BEC branch are excluded.',NULL,10,33,0,5,5,13,1,49,672,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/lazarus-de46','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/lazarus-de46','lazarus-de46.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1005,T1036,T1053.005,T1071.001,T1105,T1140,T1204.001,T1204.002,T1218.011,T1220,T1560.001,T1566.002,T1567.002','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,收集信息,数据泄露,防御规避'),(68,'lazarus-f951',68,NULL,'lazarus-f951','F-Secure 对 2019 年 Lazarus 集团攻击一家加密货币组织的调查。攻击链:LinkedIn 钓鱼文档 -> mshta -> VBScript -> PowerShell -> 定制植入体(LSSVC.dll、NTUSER.cat),经 LSA 安全包持久化加载进 lsass.exe。','F-Secure investigation of a 2019 Lazarus Group attack on a cryptocurrency organization. Attack chain: LinkedIn phishing doc -> mshta -> VBScript -> PowerShell -> custom implants (LSSVC.dll, NTUSER.cat) loaded into lsass.exe via LSA Security Package persistence.','Lazarus Group Campaign Targeting the Cryptocurrency Vertical',9,22,0,5,5,7,1,49,409,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/lazarus-f951','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/lazarus-f951','lazarus-f951.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003.001,T1071,T1105,T1218.005,T1547.005,T1566.003,T1571','凭据访问,初始访问,命令控制,持久化,防御规避'),(69,'molerats',69,NULL,'molerats','加沙网络黑帮 G1(MoleRATs)实施「SneakyPastes」行动,针对中东北非地区使馆、政府机构、媒体、记者与政治人物。该行动利用链式粘贴板阶段投递 .NET RAT 并规避检测。','Gaza Cybergang Group1 (MoleRATs) conducted Operation SneakyPastes targeting embassies, government entities, media, journalists, and political personnel in the MENA region. The campaign used chained paste-site stages to deliver a .NET RAT while evading detection.','Gaza Cybergang Group1, operation SneakyPastes',7,8,0,5,5,5,1,49,671,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/molerats','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/molerats','molerats.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1041,T1053.005,T1102.001,T1547.001,T1566.001','初始访问,命令控制,持久化,数据泄露'),(70,'muddywater',70,NULL,'muddywater','污水资源(MuddyWater)于 2020 年 9 月实施「流沙」(Quicksand)行动,针对以色列知名组织,采用两类攻击向量:漏洞利用(CVE-2020-0688、CVE-2020-1472)与社会工程(恶意 PDF/Excel)。行动部署了 PowGoop 加载器与 Covicli 后门,并可能具备经 Thanos 勒索擦除器实施破坏的能力。','MuddyWater conducted Operation Quicksand targeting prominent Israeli organizations in September 2020, using two attack vectors: exploit-based (CVE-2020-0688, CVE-2020-1472) and social engineering (malicious PDF/Excel). The campaign deployed PowGoop loader and Covicli backdoor, with potential destructive capability via Thanos ransomware wiper.','Operation Quicksand: MuddyWater\'s Offensive Attack Against Israeli Organizations',10,11,0,5,5,8,1,49,882,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/muddywater','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/muddywater','muddywater.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1053.005,T1071,T1071.001,T1105,T1204.002,T1566.002,T1572,T1574.001','初始访问,命令控制,执行,持久化,防御规避'),(71,'muddywater-dev',71,NULL,'muddywater-dev','MERCURY(污水/MuddyWater,芒果沙尘暴)利用 Log4j 漏洞获取初始访问,随后与 DEV-1084(Storm-1084/DarkBit)协同,对本地与 Azure 云环境实施破坏性作战,部署 DarkBit 勒索擦除器并大规模删除 Azure 资源。','MERCURY (MuddyWater/Mango Sandstorm) exploited Log4j vulnerabilities for initial access, then partnered with DEV-1084 (Storm-1084/DarkBit) to conduct destructive operations against on-premises and Azure cloud environments, deploying DarkBit ransomware wiper and mass-deleting Azure resources.','MERCURY and DEV-1084: Destructive Attack on Hybrid Environment',5,5,0,5,5,5,0,46,828,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/muddywater-dev','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/muddywater-dev','muddywater-dev.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1003,T1021,T1059.001,T1486,T1572','侵害影响,凭据访问,命令控制,执行,横向移动'),(72,'oceanlotus',72,NULL,'oceanlotus','海莲花（OceanLotus/APT32）组织以社保、公积金调整等字眼为诱饵，投递内嵌 lnk 参数、HTA 脚本、dropper 程序及诱饵文档的复合样本，最终解密加载 Cobalt Strike Beacon 建立 C2 通信。','海莲花（OceanLotus/APT32）组织以社保、公积金调整等字眼为诱饵，投递内嵌 lnk 参数、HTA 脚本、dropper 程序及诱饵文档的复合样本，最终解密加载 Cobalt Strike Beacon 建立 C2 通信。','威胁情报 海莲花组织以社保话题为诱饵进行 APT 攻击',8,9,0,5,5,6,1,49,341,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/oceanlotus','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/oceanlotus','oceanlotus.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1036,T1036.006,T1071,T1140,T1566.001,T1574.001','初始访问,命令控制,防御规避'),(73,'uat4356',73,NULL,'uat4356','Cisco Talos 发现 ArcaneDoor——由 UAT4356/STORM-1849 实施的国家级间谍行动,针对 Cisco ASA 边界设备。攻击者部署两款定制后门:Line Dancer(仅内存的 shellcode 解释器)与 Line Runner(持久化 Lua HTTP 后门),利用 CVE-2024-20353 与 CVE-2024-20359 实施侦察、流量抓取与数据外传。','Cisco Talos discovered ArcaneDoor, a state-sponsored espionage campaign by UAT4356/STORM-1849 targeting Cisco ASA perimeter devices. The actor deployed two custom backdoors: Line Dancer (memory-only shellcode interpreter) and Line Runner (persistent Lua HTTP backdoor), exploiting CVE-2024-20353 and CVE-2024-20359 to conduct reconnaissance, traffic capture, and exfiltration.','ArcaneDoor - New espionage-focused campaign found targeting perimeter network devices',6,6,0,5,5,5,0,43,907,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/uat4356','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/uat4356','uat4356.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1070.004,T1071.001,T1203,T1556,T1686','凭据访问,命令控制,执行,防御规避'),(74,'unknown-zaardoor',74,NULL,'unknown-zaardoor','Cisco Talos 发现一起至少自 2021 年 3 月活跃的隐蔽间谍行动,目标为沙特一家伊斯兰非营利组织。威胁行为体部署了定制 Zardoor 后门、改装的反向代理工具(FRP、sSocks、Venom),并利用 LoLBins 建立 C2、维持持久化,约每月两次外传数据。','Cisco Talos discovered a stealthy espionage campaign active since at least March 2021 targeting an Islamic non-profit organization in Saudi Arabia. The threat actor deployed the custom Zardoor backdoor, modified reverse proxy tools (FRP, sSocks, Venom), and used LoLBins to establish C2, maintain persistence, and exfiltrate data approximately twice a month.','New Zardoor backdoor used in long-term cyber espionage operation targeting an Islamic organization',8,9,0,5,5,6,0,46,423,NULL,0,0,'/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged/unknown-zaardoor','/mnt/raid0/xj/ZGCAPTDataset/多源异构日志数据/quality-corpus-merged-scenarios/unknown-zaardoor','unknown-zaardoor.json','2026-08-26 13:53:14','T1048,T1053.005,T1071,T1090.003,T1572,T1574.001','命令控制,持久化,数据泄露,防御规避');

